  "body": "https://w3c.github.io/IntersectionObserver/#pending-initial-observation describes an additional requirement for skipping document rendering in the HTML Event Loops Processing Model which is not documented in the _Unnecessary rendering_ portion of the **[Update the rendering step](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#update-the-rendering)**. This issue tracks adding this directly to the processing model spec.\r\n\r\nIssue w3c/IntersectionObserver#498 tracks removing the existing section once this has been closed.",
